{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"7a71c1757ffd1afec829c2e11c9e9b9c42d2262a479a215701e5cb67a85f1043","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["有关祷告的指示"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我劝你，第一要为万人恳求、祷告、代求、祝谢；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["为君王和一切在位的，也该如此，使我们可以敬虔、端正、平安无事地度日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["这是好的，在 神我们救主面前可蒙悦纳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他愿意万人得救，明白真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为只有一位 神，在 神和人中间，只有一位中保，乃是降世为人的基督耶稣；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他舍自己作万人的赎价，到了时候，这事必证明出来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我为此奉派作传道的，作使徒，作外邦人的师傅，教导他们相信，学习真道。我说的是真话，并不是谎言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我愿男人无忿怒，无争论",{"noteId":0},"，举起圣洁的手，随处祷告；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又愿女人廉耻、自守，以正派衣裳为妆饰，不以编发、黄金、珍珠，和贵价的衣裳为妆饰，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["只要有善行，这才与自称是敬 神的女人相宜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女人要沉静学道，一味地顺服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我不许女人讲道，也不许她辖管男人，只要沉静。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为先造的是亚当，后造的是夏娃，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["且不是亚当被引诱，乃是女人被引诱，陷在罪里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["然而，女人若常存信心、爱心，又圣洁自守，就必在生产上得救。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译：疑惑","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}